 "notes": [
  "Posted 9 July 2001, before Coruscant; the list has no Coruscant-set card, so the format is Premiere - Tatooine.",
  "No Objective: the deck starts Endor with Operational As Planned, which takes Death Star II, Moff Jerjerrod and an Effect (Imperial Arrest Order, or Desperate Counter 'if you suspect heavy air') into hand. All five cards in the 'Start' section count toward the total.",
  "Operational As Planned is listed twice (Start and again under 'More Red'); both are kept as published.",
  "Total is 61 as published.",
  "Posted 'DS2' dested Death Star II (Dark); 'Endor', 'Sullust', 'Kashyyyk' and 'Restraining Bolt' dested the Dark pages; 'Empy's Sword' / 'Empy's Shield' dested The Emperor's Sword / The Emperor's Shield; 'Moby Points' dested Mobilization Points.",
  "Section headers (People, Random Cards, Green Cards, Boats, FX, More Red) were mis-read as cards in the draft and are removed.",
  "Secret Plans, Come Here You Big Coward and There Is No Try & Oppressive Enforcement were Effects in 2001 (not Defensive Shields).",
  "The strategy reports a 4-2 record in sanctioned play (one game detailed in the author's Geneva tournament report); no event finish is given, so it stays a general deck."
 ],
